                <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">Research</h1>
                <p class="lead">NHGRI GREAT Scholar | UC Santa Cruz Genomics Institute</p>
                <p>Through the NIH NHGRI-funded GREAT Scholars program, I am paired with Dr. Benedict Paten's lab at
                    the UC Santa Cruz Genomics Institute, working on performance improvements to pangenome graph tooling
                    in the <a href="https://github.com/vgteam" target="_blank" class="link-dark">vg toolkit</a>.</p>
            </div>
