                    This is my first research experience and it's still early. Right now I'm focused on understanding
                    the existing Python implementation, the vg codebase, and the biology behind snarl-based anchor
                    generation. I'm working toward producing a C++ implementation that passes the same correctness
                    tests and measurably improves performance.
                </p>
